      3imp ) ABDZAEFZAGHZIZBJHZAKZBHZVCVDVEVGVILZVCVDVEVJLLVEVCVCVDVJVCVEVCVDVJ
      LLZVEVCABSZHZVEVKLABGMVEVCVDVMVJVCVDVEVMVJLZVCVDVEVNVMVFVJCNZBDZVOEFZVOGH
      ZIZVGVOKZBHZLZLVFVJLCAVLVOAOZVSVFWBVJWCVPVCVQVDVRVEVOABPVOAEQVOAGUAUBWCWA
      VIVGWCVTVHBVOAUCUDUEUFVPVOUGBHLCTZVSWALZCTZUHZVSWAVGWFWEWDWECUIUJVGWGCJBU
      LUKUMUNRUOUPUQURUSUTVAVBR $.

    $( The intersection of a nonempty finite family of open sets is open.
       (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 14-Sep-2014.) $)
    iinopn $p |- ( ( J e. Top /\ ( A e. Fin /\ A =/= (/) /\
      A. x e. A B e. J ) ) -> |^|_ x e. A B e. J ) $=
      ( vy ctop wcel cfn c0 wne wral w3a wa ciin cv wceq wrex cab syl sylib wss
      cint simpr3 dfiin2g simpl cmpt crn eqid rnmpt wf fmpt frnd eqsstrrid fdmd
