      VAVJURUSVGVAVJABCDUNUMUOUPTUQ $.

    $( A finite relative intersection of open sets is open.  (Contributed by
       Mario Carneiro, 22-Aug-2015.) $)
    rintopn $p |- ( ( J e. Top /\ A C_ J /\ A e. Fin ) ->
        ( X i^i |^| A ) e. J ) $=
      ( vx ctop wcel wss cfn w3a cint cin ciin intiin ineq2i wral dfss3 riinopn
      cv 3com23 syl3an2b eqeltrid ) BFGZABHZAIGZJCAKZLCEAESZMZLZBUFUHCEANOUDUCU
      GBGEAPZUEUIBGZEABQUCUEUJUKEAUGBCDRTUAUB $.
