      HICBAJKL $.
  $}

  $( A topology is the same thing as a topology on the union of its open sets.
     (Contributed by BJ, 27-Apr-2021.) $)
  toptopon2 $p |- ( J e. Top <-> J e. ( TopOn ` U. J ) ) $=
    ( cuni eqid toptopon ) AABZECD $.

  $( A topology on a set is a topology on the union of its open sets.
     (Contributed by BJ, 27-Apr-2021.) $)
  topontopon $p |- ( J e. ( TopOn ` X ) -> J e. ( TopOn ` U. J ) ) $=
    ( ctopon cfv wcel ctop cuni topontop toptopon2 sylib ) ABCDEAFEAAGCDEBAHAIJ
    $.

  ${
    $d x y $.
