    ALMBANOUCAPZBHZUDUCBUEQUFBARUEBSMABTUAUB $.

  $( The only topology on a singleton is the discrete topology (which is also
     the indiscrete topology by ~ pwsn ).  (Contributed by FL, 5-Jan-2009.)
     (Revised by Mario Carneiro, 16-Sep-2015.) $)
  topsn $p |- ( J e. ( TopOn ` { A } ) -> J = ~P { A } ) $=
    ( csn ctopon cfv wcel cpw cpr wss topgele simprd pwsn simpld eqsstrid eqssd
