               ( Clsd ` J ) = { x e. ~P X | ( X \ x ) e. J } ) $=
      ( vj ctop wcel cv cdif cpw crab cvv ccld cfv wceq topopn rabexg 3syl cuni
      pwexg unieq eqtr4di pweqd wb difeq1d eleq12 rabeqbidv df-cld fvmptg mpdan
