    $( A topological space is T_0 iff it is homeomorphic to its Kolmogorov
       quotient.  (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 25-Aug-2015.) $)
    kqhmph $p |- ( J e. Kol2 <-> J ~= ( KQ ` J ) ) $=
      ( vx vy ct0 wcel ckq cfv chmph wbr cuni crab cmpt chmeo co ctopon wb ctop
