    cnextfres.a $e |- ( ph -> A C_ C ) $.
    cnextfres.1 $e |- ( ph -> F e. ( ( J |`t A ) Cn K ) ) $.
    cnextfres.x $e |- ( ph -> X e. A ) $.
    $( ` F ` and its extension by continuity agree on the domain of ` F ` .
       (Contributed by Thierry Arnoux, 29-Aug-2020.) $)
    cnextfres $p |- ( ph -> ( ( ( J CnExt K ) ` F ) ` X ) = ( F ` X ) ) $=
      ( vx co cfv wceq wcel ccnext wfun wbr ctop cha wf wss crest cuni ccn eqid
      cnf syl restuni syl2anc mpbird cnextfun syl22anc cop ccl cv csn cnei cflf
