  $( Extend class notation with the set of Cauchy filter bases. $)
  ccfilu $a class CauFilU $.

  ${
    $d u f v a $.
    $( Define the set of Cauchy filter bases on a uniform space.  A Cauchy
       filter base is a filter base on the set such that for every entourage
       ` v ` , there is an element ` a ` of the filter "small enough in
       ` v ` " i.e. such that every pair ` { x , y } ` of points in ` a ` is
       related by ` v ` ".  Definition 2 of [BourbakiTop1] p.  II.13.
       (Contributed by Thierry Arnoux, 16-Nov-2017.) $)
    df-cfilu $a |- CauFilU = ( u e. U. ran UnifOn |->
        { f e. ( fBas ` dom U. u ) | A. v e. u E. a e. f ( a X. a ) C_ v } ) $.
  $}

